The current code only uses OHLCV + indicators.

Add support for the options columns already present in the combined local options dataset.

Options columns are identified by:

```text
expiry1_
expiry2_
expiry3_
```

Only include numeric options columns.

Add a function similar to:

```python
def resolve_options_columns(dataframe):
    options_columns = [
        column
        for column in dataframe.columns
        if (
            column.startswith("expiry1_")
            or column.startswith("expiry2_")
            or column.startswith("expiry3_")
        )
        and pd.api.types.is_numeric_dtype(dataframe[column])
    ]

    return options_columns
```

Preserve the original dataframe column order.

Do not randomly reorder options columns.

